<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <%- include('../../partials/public-head', { title: 'STEM Education', description: 'STEM Education at Akansha Grammar High School - Inspiring innovation through Science, Technology, Engineering, and Mathematics' }) %>
</head>
<body class="site program-page">
    <%- include('../../partials/public-navbar') %>

    <main id="main">
    <%- include('../../partials/page-hero', {
      heroPhoto: 'program-stem',
      heroCrumbs: [{ href: '/', label: 'Home' }, { href: '/portfolio/academics', label: 'Academics' }, { label: 'STEM Education' }],
      heroTitle: 'STEM<br>Education',
      heroText: 'Inspiring innovation through Science, Technology, Engineering, and Mathematics'
    }) %>

    <div class="program-content program-body">
        <section>
            <h2>Overview</h2>
            <p>Our comprehensive STEM Education program integrates Science, Technology, Engineering, and Mathematics to foster critical thinking, creativity, and innovation. Through hands-on projects, real-world applications, and cutting-edge technology, we prepare students for careers in the fastest-growing fields of the 21st century.</p>
        </section>

        <div class="stats-container">
            <div class="stat-box">
                <div class="stat-number">5</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Specialized Labs</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-box">
                <div class="stat-number">100+</div>
                <div class="stat-label">STEM Projects Annually</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-box">
                <div class="stat-number">25+</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Industry Partnerships</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-box">
                <div class="stat-number">90%</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Competition Success Rate</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-grid">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon"><%- icon('microscope') %></div>
                <h3>Advanced Science</h3>
                <p>State-of-the-art laboratories for Physics, Chemistry, and Biology. Hands-on experiments, research projects, and participation in national science competitions and olympiads.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon"><%- icon('laptop') %></div>
                <h3>Computer Science & Coding</h3>
                <p>Programming in Python, Java, C++, and web development. Coding competitions, hackathons, and software development projects. AI and machine learning introductions.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon"><%- icon('bot') %></div>
                <h3>Robotics & Automation</h3>
                <p>Build and program robots using Arduino, Raspberry Pi, and LEGO Mindstorms. Participate in robotics competitions like FIRST Robotics and World Robot Olympiad.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon"><%- icon('cog') %></div>
                <h3>Engineering Design</h3>
                <p>CAD/CAM software, 3D printing, and prototyping. Design thinking workshops and engineering challenges. Bridge building, structural design projects.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon"><%- icon('chart-column') %></div>
                <h3>Data Science & Analytics</h3>
                <p>Introduction to data analysis, statistics, and visualization. Working with real datasets and learning tools like Excel, Python pandas, and Tableau.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon"><%- icon('leaf') %></div>
                <h3>Environmental Science</h3>
                <p>Sustainability projects, renewable energy experiments, water quality testing, and environmental conservation initiatives. Green technology and eco-innovation.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <section class="panel">
            <h2>STEM Curriculum Integration</h2>
            <div class="feature-grid">
                <div class="level-item">
                    <h4>Primary Level (Nursery-5)</h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Introduction to scientific method</li>
                        <li>Basic coding with Scratch</li>
                        <li>Simple machines and engineering</li>
                        <li>Math problem-solving games</li>
                        <li>Nature walks and observations</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="level-item">
                    <h4>Middle Level (6-8)</h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Advanced lab experiments</li>
                        <li>Python and web programming</li>
                        <li>Robotics competitions</li>
                        <li>Algebra and geometry applications</li>
                        <li>Science fair projects</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="level-item">
                    <h4>High School (9-10)</h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Research-based learning</li>
                        <li>Advanced programming & AI</li>
                        <li>Engineering design projects</li>
                        <li>Algebra, geometry and statistics</li>
                        <li>Internships and mentorships</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Specialized Programs</h2>
            <div class="feature-grid">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <h4>STEM Olympiads</h4>
                    <p>Preparation and participation in national and international olympiads including:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Mathematics Olympiad (IMO)</li>
                        <li>Physics Olympiad (IPhO)</li>
                        <li>Chemistry Olympiad (IChO)</li>
                        <li>Biology Olympiad (IBO)</li>
                        <li>Informatics Olympiad (IOI)</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <h4>Innovation Lab</h4>
                    <p>A dedicated maker space equipped with:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>3D printers and laser cutters</li>
                        <li>Electronics workbenches</li>
                        <li>Prototyping materials</li>
                        <li>Design software</li>
                        <li>Collaboration spaces</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <h4>Research Mentorship</h4>
                    <p>Students work with university professors and industry experts on:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Independent research projects</li>
                        <li>Paper writing and publication</li>
                        <li>Conference presentations</li>
                        <li>Patent applications</li>
                        <li>Science exhibitions</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <h4>Competitions & Events</h4>
                    <p>Regular participation in:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Google Science Fair</li>
                        <li>IRIS National Fair</li>
                        <li>Techfest IIT Bombay</li>
                        <li>Coding competitions (CodeChef, HackerRank)</li>
                        <li>Robotics championships</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <h4>Industry Partnerships</h4>
                    <p>Collaborations with leading companies for:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Guest lectures and workshops</li>
                        <li>Industry visits and tours</li>
                        <li>Internship opportunities</li>
                        <li>Real-world project challenges</li>
                        <li>Career guidance sessions</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <h4>STEM Clubs</h4>
                    <p>After-school clubs including:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Coding Club</li>
                        <li>Robotics Club</li>
                        <li>Astronomy Club</li>
                        <li>Math Club</li>
                        <li>Science Quiz Club</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Facilities & Equipment</h2>
            <ul class="check-list check-list--cols">
                <li>Physics Lab with advanced apparatus</li>
                <li>Chemistry Lab with safety equipment</li>
                <li>Biology Lab with microscopes and specimens</li>
                <li>Computer Lab with 50+ workstations</li>
                <li>Robotics Lab with kits and tools</li>
                <li>Innovation/Maker Space with 3D printers</li>
                <li>Mathematics Lab with manipulatives</li>
                <li>Electronics Lab with testing equipment</li>
                <li>Planetarium for astronomy education</li>
                <li>Virtual Reality learning stations</li>
                <li>High-speed internet and cloud computing</li>
                <li>Scientific software and simulation tools</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="panel">
            <h2>Career Pathways</h2>
            <p>Our STEM program prepares students for careers in:</p>
            <div class="feature-grid">
                <div>
                    <h4>Engineering</h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Computer Engineering</li>
                        <li>Mechanical Engineering</li>
                        <li>Electrical Engineering</li>
                        <li>Aerospace Engineering</li>
                        <li>Biomedical Engineering</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h4>Technology</h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Software Development</li>
                        <li>Data Science</li>
                        <li>Cybersecurity</li>
                        <li>AI/Machine Learning</li>
                        <li>Game Development</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h4>Science</h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Research Scientist</li>
                        <li>Biotechnology</li>
                        <li>Environmental Science</li>
                        <li>Pharmaceutical Sciences</li>
                        <li>Space Sciences</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="program-cta">
            <h2>Join Our STEM Revolution</h2>
            <p>Discover the excitement of STEM education and prepare for the careers of tomorrow!</p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
                <a href="/portfolio/contact" class="pill pill--light">Contact Us <%- icon('arrow-right') %></a>
                <a href="/portfolio/admissions" class="pill pill--dark">Admissions</a>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>
    </main>


    <%- include('../../partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>